        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rA private client has requested our assistance. A covert cell of specialised militia operatives — each highly skilled in a different discipline.\rThe client alleges these specialists have been destabilizing nearby communities with arms transfers, sabotage, and cyber-attacks on critical infrastructure. He wants the cell neutralised quietly; the matter must not escalate into a public incident or draw federal attention.",
